{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3005", "source_sha256": "a2004d13ceaf8be251e7e4dbbfbb44ed16b8c5d112ba6cc26b27cfdf9909c664", "ja": "落ち着いて考えよう", "zh": "冷静下来思考吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3100_p", "source_sha256": "c07fc1cd5ce434128bb539be56bc7c6d451b1e1ed4929d05620d4e776ba2ff20", "ja": "この際、細かいことは考えるな！\n思いきって、ドーンとぶつかればいいんだ。", "zh": "这时候，就别想得太复杂！\n下定决心放手去做就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3101_017kth", "source_sha256": "7482f61068f727042efc814603f18b308295c30e52ae86781da6d56a41bcce5b", "ja": "は、はい！　……そうですね。\n今さらくよくよ悩んでも、しょうがないか。", "zh": "好、好的！……说得也是。\n现在就算一直烦恼也不是办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3102_017kth", "source_sha256": "9b402534a1cd255b74fc8f3614ec846b54742b10ea1a51c8e6a403b50ff8e6c0", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\n私、思いきってぶつかってみようと思います。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。\n我会下定决心放手去试试看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3200_p", "source_sha256": "c07fc1cd5ce434128bb539be56bc7c6d451b1e1ed4929d05620d4e776ba2ff20", "ja": "この際、細かいことは考えるな！\n思いきって、ドーンとぶつかればいいんだ。", "zh": "这时候，就别想得太复杂！\n下定决心放手去做就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3201_017kth", "source_sha256": "c82fb6e1311b3ab67b79e3a40743d2e252560f360e27b1e46a6ffd614592fc28", "ja": "そうですね。でも私、つい細かいことが気になって……\nううん。それでも、やらなくちゃいけませんよね。", "zh": "说得也是。可是我总是会不由自主地钻牛角尖……\n不对，就算是这样，也还是得去做呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3202_017kth", "source_sha256": "9e48af1076bc5f6ac4ebf232b1bed437b0ba61875ba056396e0e50460fbe9a68", "ja": "アドバイス、ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}。それじゃ、いってきます。", "zh": "谢谢你的建议，{$P$}。\n那么，我上场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
