{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3301_017kth", "source_sha256": "df18861d263085c7df3d9b2530d5fee69cfe3dc2059a2752724e00d905ca2d56", "ja": "は、はい。……そっか。私、焦ってたんだ……。\nご心配をおかけしてすみません。もう大丈夫です！", "zh": "好、好的……的确，我刚才太心急了……\n不好意思让你担心了，我已经没事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
