{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3400_p", "source_sha256": "9329cb389adf0fe1fa50a745e280ad54b2fbd4a338186878de3223fa12ca129e", "ja": "闇雲に動いても、かえって気持ちが焦るばかりだぞ。\nこんなときこそ、落ち着いて考えるんだ。", "zh": "没头没脑地练，也只会让心情更急躁喔。\n这种时候更应该要冷静思考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_017kth_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_017kth_3401_017kth", "source_sha256": "2cc34ae281ce58a7c3fb4949b2e66a9812dc9b90b924056877f1c1dd33c2b09b", "ja": "あ……そ、そうでしたね。すいません。\nやっぱり私、まだまだだなあ……。", "zh": "啊……说、说得也是，抱歉。\n我果然还不够成熟呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
